    {
      "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42122",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "POMPEY.\nIf the great gods be just, they shall assist\nThe deeds of justest men.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42122/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42122/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 52,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42122/line-3",
          "start": 53,
          "end": 78,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 349861,
        "end": 349974,
        "line": 11998,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap03/p@42122",
        "anchor": "sceneII_3.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "POMPEY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42239",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MENECRATES.\nKnow, worthy Pompey,\nThat what they do delay they not deny.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42239/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42239/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 32,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42239/line-3",
          "start": 33,
          "end": 71,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 349978,
        "end": 350084,
        "line": 12004,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap03/p@42239",
        "anchor": "sceneII_3.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MENECRATES.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42349",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "POMPEY.\nWhiles we are suitors to their throne, decays\nThe thing we sue for.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42349/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42349/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 53,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42349/line-3",
          "start": 54,
          "end": 75,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 350088,
        "end": 350198,
        "line": 12010,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap03/p@42349",
        "anchor": "sceneII_3.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "POMPEY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42463",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MENECRATES.\nWe, ignorant of ourselves,\nBeg often our own harms, which the wise powers\nDeny us for our good; so find we profit\nBy losing of our prayers.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42463/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 11,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42463/line-2",
          "start": 12,
          "end": 38,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42463/line-3",
          "start": 39,
          "end": 85,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42463/line-4",
          "start": 86,
          "end": 125,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42463/line-5",
          "start": 126,
          "end": 151,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 350202,
        "end": 350398,
        "line": 12016,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap03/p@42463",
        "anchor": "sceneII_3.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MENECRATES.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 11
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42663",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "POMPEY.\nI shall do well.\nThe people love me, and the sea is mine;\nMy powers are crescent, and my auguring hope\nSays it will come to th’ full. Mark Antony\nIn Egypt sits at dinner, and will make\nNo wars without doors. Caesar gets money where\nHe loses hearts. Lepidus flatters both,\nOf both is flattered; but he neither loves\nNor either cares for him.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42663/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42663/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 24,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42663/line-3",
          "start": 25,
          "end": 65,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42663/line-4",
          "start": 66,
          "end": 110,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42663/line-5",
          "start": 111,
          "end": 153,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42663/line-6",
          "start": 154,
          "end": 192,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42663/line-7",
          "start": 193,
          "end": 239,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42663/line-8",
          "start": 240,
          "end": 279,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42663/line-9",
          "start": 280,
          "end": 322,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@42663/line-10",
          "start": 323,
          "end": 348,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 350402,
        "end": 350820,
        "line": 12024,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap03/p@42663",
        "anchor": "sceneII_3.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "POMPEY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43085",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MENAS.\nCaesar and Lepidus\nAre in the field. A mighty strength they carry.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43085/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43085/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 25,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43085/line-3",
          "start": 26,
          "end": 73,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 350824,
        "end": 350932,
        "line": 12037,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap03/p@43085",
        "anchor": "sceneII_3.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MENAS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43197",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "POMPEY.\nWhere have you this? ’Tis false.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43197/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43197/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 40,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 350936,
        "end": 351006,
        "line": 12043,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap03/p@43197",
        "anchor": "sceneII_3.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "POMPEY.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43271",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "MENAS.\nFrom Silvius, sir.",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43271/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 6,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43271/line-2",
          "start": 7,
          "end": 25,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        }
      ],
      "sourceRef": {
        "start": 351010,
        "end": 351065,
        "line": 12048,
        "column": 1,
        "path": "chap03/p@43271",
        "anchor": "sceneII_3.1"
      },
      "speakerLabel": "MENAS.",
      "attribution": {
        "status": "explicit",
        "cueStart": 0,
        "cueEnd": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43330",
      "type": "speech",
      "tag": "p",
      "classes": [
        "drama"
      ],
      "text": "POMPEY.\nHe dreams. I know they are in Rome together,\nLooking for Antony. But all the charms of love,\nSalt Cleopatra, soften thy waned lip!\nLet witchcraft join with beauty, lust with both;\nTie up the libertine in a field of feasts;\nKeep his brain fuming. Epicurean cooks\nSharpen with cloyless sauce his appetite,\nThat sleep and feeding may prorogue his honour\nEven till a Lethe’d dullness—",
      "separatorAfter": "\n\n",
      "spans": [],
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43330/line-1",
          "start": 0,
          "end": 7,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43330/line-2",
          "start": 8,
          "end": 52,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43330/line-3",
          "start": 53,
          "end": 100,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43330/line-4",
          "start": 101,
          "end": 138,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43330/line-5",
          "start": 139,
          "end": 187,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43330/line-6",
          "start": 188,
          "end": 230,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43330/line-7",
          "start": 231,
          "end": 269,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43330/line-8",
          "start": 270,
          "end": 311,
          "sourceLineNumber": null
        },
        {
          "id": "antony-and-cleopatra/sceneII_3.1/p@43330/line-9",
          "start": 312,
